      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Howdy, old friend!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: I'm here to show the ropes, in case you've forgotten in your old age!
        He He
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: This here is your board!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Your hand of cards is on the bottom! Hover your mouse over a card to
        select it!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Those circles at the top left? Those are Time Slots!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[5]'
      value: When you have a card selected, press the number of whatever time slot
        you want to play it too!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[6]'
      value: For example, if you want to play a card to time slot 1, press the 1
        key!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[7]'
      value: '"What does a card do in a time slot?" you may ask!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[8]'
      value: See that number at the top of a card? That's the cost!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[9]'
      value: When you play a card to time slot, it'll stay there for that many seconds!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: speakers.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[2]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1763014460331064234, guid: 2a4cb049d1b2bae4abb3a4e56eb8a0f2, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[3]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -7875845867806776876, guid: 2f42043d77dd6d8478d68d945fde8326, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[4]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -2129135656917597007, guid: 06d89a71db51fb44e8dc8d785eb76b79, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[5]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -2129135656917597007, guid: 06d89a71db51fb44e8dc8d785eb76b79, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[6]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -2129135656917597007, guid: 06d89a71db51fb44e8dc8d785eb76b79, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[7]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[8]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 6803528478433960357, guid: cea046394b900674c8a294b7a354b5cf, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[9]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 6803528478433960357, guid: cea046394b900674c8a294b7a354b5cf, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[10]'
      value: When the timer hits zero, the card will activate and do its effect!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[11]'
      value: And that's the big picture!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[12]'
      value: Let's talk about Defend cards!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[13]'
      value: When a Defend is in a time slot, your cursor because a tiny badge! It's
        hard to see but its there!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[14]'
      value: You can hover the badge over anything! As close to you or as far as
        you want!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[15]'
      value: When the timer hits ZERO, the defend will activate! No clicking required!!!
        Any bullets in the badge will be bocked when the timer hits zero!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[16]'
      value: If you want to learn about your cards or weapons, press the escape key!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[17]'
      value: This will open the inventory which will also let you change your weapon
        and deck! You can also exit back to menu here!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[18]'
      value: That's it! Now go get them Bill! Head to the right to fight the deputy
        cactus!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[10]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 6803528478433960357, guid: cea046394b900674c8a294b7a354b5cf, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[11]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[13]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 4359907078327075107, guid: 519aae99fda813041b7c6be867d8b48c, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[14]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 4359907078327075107, guid: 519aae99fda813041b7c6be867d8b48c, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'images.Array.data[15]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 4359907078327075107, guid: 519aae99fda813041b7c6be867d8b48c, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: 'Howdy, old friend! What brings you here?

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].quit
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Nevermind.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Nothing much, what's been happening in town?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: 'The usual, bar fights are getting the best out of rowdy cowboys.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: "Although\u2026."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5].text
      value: There was a recent report about some bandits terrorizing some passerby
        near the saloon.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[6].text
      value: A man was allegedly being beaten by this huge guy and barely made it
        out.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[7].quit
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[7].text
      value: "However, the report was made by a drunkard, so I wouldn\u2019t think
        much of it."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[8].quit
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[8].text
      value: Anything else I can help you with?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[9].quit
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[9].text
      value: That's it, goodbye.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[0].quit
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[0].text
      value: BIll, can you help an old friend out?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[1].quit
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[1].text
      value: Maybe later...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[2].text
      value: "I guess\u2026 What's up? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[3].text
      value: How great! Thank you, Bill!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[4].text
      value: 'Anyways, a couple rushed in here reporting an outlaw near this town!

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[5].text
      value: "I was wondering\u2026 Could you catch him? I would do it myself, but
        I\u2019m too old to be chasing these youngins!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[6].quit
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[6].text
      value: No thanks...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[7].quit
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[7].text
      value: 'It would be an honor to catch this outlaw. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[8].quit
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[8].text
      value: "Great! Now since it\u2019s been a while since you\u2019ve been in a
        shoot out, I think I should teach you some of my old tricks."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[9].quit
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines2.Array.data[9].text
      value: Here we go!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
