      value: 'Delorean is out back. No need to speak with me. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Do not call me that. It only brings back memories, ones I\u2019ve been
        tryin to lose. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'I really believed you, you know that? Sayin all those sweet things,
        tellin me how much you care. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2221923227978894502, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: "Care for Delorean. That\u2019s what I can offer you, and that\u2019s
        all. If you\u2019ll excuse me, I need to take stock of what all that Bandit
        made off with. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3123857424786346004, guid: 59e5f3de743bdc3429fc157dcb688861, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalScale.x
